{
  "status": "pass",
  "minimum_light_fraction": 0.9996101364522417,
  "line_count": 106,
  "lines": [
    {
      "frame_id": "page-01-panel-01",
      "text": "The first thing they took was my name.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        38,
        65,
        542,
        104
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-01-panel-01",
      "text": "Not with ceremony or proclamation. A shrug, and an entry in",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        842,
        46,
        1630,
        85
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-01-panel-01",
      "text": "a book.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        842,
        94,
        937,
        124
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-01-panel-02",
      "text": "I was Nagoji Sawant. Twenty-five. Huzurat cavalry,",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        101,
        63,
        1199,
        128
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-01-panel-02",
      "text": "household horse to Chimaji Appa, picked out by sardars who",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        101,
        141,
        1412,
        206
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-01-panel-02",
      "text": "had watched me ride.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        101,
        220,
        570,
        270
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-01-panel-03",
      "text": "Here I was a number.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        47,
        92,
        505,
        141
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-01-panel-04",
      "text": "Down here the hours were kept by boots on stone, and by",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        57,
        56,
        923,
        101
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-01-panel-04",
      "text": "the bucket that carried away what we left behind.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        57,
        111,
        802,
        156
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-01-panel-05",
      "text": "Above us, the bells rang for evening prayer.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        92,
        235,
        709,
        277
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-01-panel-05",
      "text": "Steady as monsoon rain on a Deccan roof.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1346,
        235,
        1940,
        277
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-01",
      "text": "Then Father Duarte came.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        36,
        74,
        433,
        110
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-02",
      "text": "A holy man built for argument, not battle.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        35,
        134,
        611,
        177
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-02",
      "text": "The calluses on his right",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1530,
        56,
        1874,
        98
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-02",
      "text": "hand said he had once held",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1530,
        107,
        1918,
        140
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-02",
      "text": "something heavier than a",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1530,
        159,
        1888,
        201
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-02",
      "text": "quill.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1530,
        210,
        1599,
        251
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-03",
      "text": "Este. This one is stubborn.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1202,
        81,
        1607,
        117
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-04",
      "text": "He smelled of garlic sausage and chapel",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1480,
        29,
        2131,
        77
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-04",
      "text": "incense.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1480,
        87,
        1616,
        124
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-04",
      "text": "He was humming the hymn the",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1478,
        251,
        1974,
        299
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-04",
      "text": "bells had played.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1478,
        309,
        1750,
        357
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-04",
      "text": "Stubborn is better than broken. In any",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1477,
        482,
        2085,
        530
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-02-panel-04",
      "text": "language.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1477,
        541,
        1635,
        589
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-01",
      "text": "How long since the last",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        131,
        111,
        473,
        155
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-01",
      "text": "questioning?",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        131,
        165,
        321,
        209
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-01",
      "text": "Two days. He still",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1650,
        110,
        1906,
        153
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-01",
      "text": "insists he is only a",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1650,
        163,
        1923,
        207
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-01",
      "text": "horseman.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1650,
        217,
        1808,
        251
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-02",
      "text": "You understand our",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1391,
        197,
        1680,
        231
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-02",
      "text": "language, senhor marata?",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1391,
        250,
        1777,
        294
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-03",
      "text": "Enough to know when I am being",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        82,
        129,
        590,
        175
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-03",
      "text": "lied to, Father.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        82,
        184,
        301,
        223
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-03",
      "text": "But you can speak your questions.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        82,
        240,
        609,
        285
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-03",
      "text": "I have heard most of them already.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        82,
        295,
        615,
        341
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-04",
      "text": "You see. He understands.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1111,
        293,
        1492,
        327
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-03-panel-05",
      "text": "Bring him.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        2553,
        534,
        2734,
        586
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-01",
      "text": "My joints had forgotten the shape of",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        42,
        42,
        573,
        86
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-01",
      "text": "standing.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        42,
        95,
        179,
        139
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-02",
      "text": "A Maratha horseman does not",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1506,
        24,
        1949,
        58
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-02",
      "text": "whimper in front of an enemy. We",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1506,
        77,
        2008,
        121
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-02",
      "text": "bleed, we fall, we curse the gods",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1506,
        131,
        1994,
        175
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-02",
      "text": "and get back up.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1506,
        184,
        1753,
        228
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-03",
      "text": "On the black soil of",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1772,
        56,
        2103,
        97
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-03",
      "text": "the Deccan that had",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1772,
        119,
        2115,
        159
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-03",
      "text": "been simple enough.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1772,
        182,
        2133,
        234
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-04-panel-04",
      "text": "Here it took more effort.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        39,
        66,
        408,
        102
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-05-panel-01",
      "text": "The smell changed as we walked. Rotting",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        66,
        257,
        814,
        311
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-05-panel-01",
      "text": "straw and waste gave way to oil, sweat,",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        66,
        323,
        785,
        377
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-05-panel-01",
      "text": "and something sharp that stung the nose.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        66,
        389,
        815,
        443
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-05-panel-02",
      "text": "Wine and old fear.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        46,
        196,
        343,
        234
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-05-panel-03",
      "text": "This was where the Portuguese forged",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        40,
        184,
        599,
        227
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-05-panel-03",
      "text": "information.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        40,
        236,
        216,
        270
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-06-panel-01",
      "text": "Nagoji Sawant. The Viceroy's spies insist you",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        131,
        93,
        811,
        138
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-06-panel-01",
      "text": "were huzurat cavalry under Chimaji Appa himself.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        131,
        148,
        887,
        193
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-06-panel-01",
      "text": "What we do not know is who ordered the attacks,",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        131,
        203,
        876,
        241
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-06-panel-01",
      "text": "how many men you had, and which forts you",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        131,
        257,
        808,
        302
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-06-panel-01",
      "text": "meant to strike next.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        131,
        312,
        440,
        347
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-06-panel-02",
      "text": "You know more than I do, then.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        353,
        140,
        869,
        182
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-06-panel-02",
      "text": "You have maps and books. You draw",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        353,
        200,
        964,
        250
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-06-panel-02",
      "text": "lines on paper and call them borders.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        353,
        261,
        975,
        310
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-06-panel-03",
      "text": "My horse does",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        188,
        191,
        528,
        260
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-06-panel-03",
      "text": "not read.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        188,
        275,
        394,
        329
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-06-panel-04",
      "text": "Your horse is dead. We shot it",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        468,
        43,
        991,
        84
      ],
      "light_fraction": 0.9999533647344122
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-06-panel-04",
      "text": "when we brought you in.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        468,
        106,
        901,
        159
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-06-panel-04",
      "text": "A pity. Fine animal.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        468,
        170,
        802,
        222
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-07-panel-01",
      "text": "Then he died better than I will.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        385,
        227,
        788,
        258
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-07-panel-02",
      "text": "Tell me this at least, Nagoji. Not for the Viceroy. For",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1110,
        121,
        1830,
        164
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-07-panel-02",
      "text": "me.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1110,
        182,
        1162,
        205
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-07-panel-02",
      "text": "Do you believe you fight for God, for some higher",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1110,
        223,
        1799,
        266
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-07-panel-02",
      "text": "good, or is it simply for plunder and the honour of",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1110,
        275,
        1811,
        317
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-07-panel-02",
      "text": "your people?",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1110,
        325,
        1293,
        368
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-07-panel-03",
      "text": "For an instant the dungeon was gone, and I was on a ridge above",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        897,
        235,
        1978,
        285
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-07-panel-03",
      "text": "the Godavari, watching the dust of a marching column.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        896,
        295,
        1807,
        345
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-07-panel-04",
      "text": "I fight because I was born into a world where men who do not",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        170,
        179,
        1003,
        220
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-07-panel-04",
      "text": "fight are trampled.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        170,
        228,
        421,
        268
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-07-panel-04",
      "text": "As for God, Father, I leave Him to the Brahmins and to you.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        170,
        277,
        955,
        317
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-07-panel-04",
      "text": "He seems to favour whoever has the better powder.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        170,
        326,
        866,
        366
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-07-panel-05",
      "text": "You see. He gives you nothing.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1564,
        349,
        2084,
        400
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-07-panel-05",
      "text": "Let me loosen his tongue.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1564,
        410,
        2001,
        461
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-08-panel-03",
      "text": "The first wedge went under what remained of my",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        51,
        49,
        789,
        94
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-08-panel-03",
      "text": "left thumbnail.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        51,
        104,
        268,
        138
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-08-panel-03",
      "text": "After that, pain lost its degrees.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        51,
        158,
        521,
        203
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-08-panel-04",
      "text": "Once you have felt your joints forced against the way they were meant to",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        67,
        192,
        1146,
        237
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-08-panel-04",
      "text": "bend, the mind floats above the body and watches priests and gaolers ply",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        67,
        246,
        1159,
        290
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-08-panel-04",
      "text": "their trade.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        67,
        300,
        231,
        334
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-08-panel-05",
      "text": "Not yet.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        126,
        51,
        240,
        96
      ],
      "light_fraction": 0.9996101364522417
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-08-panel-05",
      "text": "The Viceroy needs a hand that",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        125,
        106,
        585,
        151
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-08-panel-05",
      "text": "can still hold a quill.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        126,
        161,
        432,
        206
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-08-panel-06",
      "text": "Enough.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1512,
        167,
        1635,
        213
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-08-panel-06",
      "text": "He still holds back",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1502,
        347,
        1784,
        383
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-08-panel-06",
      "text": "names.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1502,
        412,
        1614,
        438
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-08-panel-06",
      "text": "A dead prisoner cannot",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1312,
        549,
        1669,
        595
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-08-panel-06",
      "text": "testify.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        1311,
        605,
        1415,
        651
      ],
      "light_fraction": 1.0
    },
    {
      "frame_id": "page-09-panel-01",
      "text": "I closed my eyes. Not in prayer. In calculation.",
      "source_pixel_rect": [
        883,
